WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:00.988
Check seven.

2
00:00:00.988 --> 00:00:03.988
Learn says an expired
inspection certificate

3
00:00:03.988 --> 00:00:06.988
disables all TLS inspection
across the tenant.

4
00:00:06.988 --> 00:00:09.074
When does the kit fail the certificate?

5
00:00:09.074 --> 00:00:10.587
On the day it expires?

6
00:00:10.587 --> 00:00:14.851
With ninety days or fewer left, or
less than six months' validity?

7
00:00:14.851 --> 00:00:16.775
Only after inspection stops?

8
00:00:16.775 --> 00:00:19.390
Or never, because renewal is manual?
